{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/226731-earnest-p-whorrel-tammuz","id":226731,"title":"Earnest P. Whorrel, Tammuz","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-12T20:16:10-07:00","id":226731,"title":"Earnest P. Whorrel, Tammuz","content":"Watched Earnest Goes to Camp with the kids and a buddy and we realized that Earnest was a Golem.<br /> <br /> Alienated by others? <b>check</b>.<br /> People want to take advantage of him? <b>Check</b><br /> Weirdly indestructible? <b>Check</b><br /> Lands somewhere in the Uncanny Valley? <b>Check</b><br /> Doesn't seem to comprehend people? <b>Check</b><br /> Craves Human Affection? <b>Check</b><br /> <br /> Just saying","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T22:04:02-07:00","id":226788,"title":"","content":"He seems slightly too talkative to be a Tammuz, but a promethean of some kind makes sense. <br /> <br /> Especially when you take the things he does in <i>Earnest goes to Jail</i> into account. He gets electrocuted and goes from being magnetically charged, to throwing lightning bolts around, and then at the end of the movie he becomes polarized and looses his grip with gravity...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T23:39:50-07:00","id":226818,"title":"","content":"I went with Tammuz because of the way people use him as apposed to killing/raping/lashing out... and just because Tammuz tend to be quiet (though I thought that was a Frankenstein thing) doesn't mean they all are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-13T10:26:48-07:00","id":227121,"title":"","content":"Tammuz on Aurum. He's only talkative when he thinks someone will be a friend and he sees friends talk all the time.<br /> <br /> <i>Ernest Scared Stupid</i> was one of my favorites as a kid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S8EuNtxeJKwq4sKVVPe16_N0ylIashKpgfCCuA1UOM8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Promethean Homebrew.</a><br /> <br /> Yes, I made it the same way as a Promethean. No, the authorities haven't found me yet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","name":"Ben Quo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/cor